# What every landscape holds of what happened, by day and at its own dusk
# (SkyLight.SUNSET is 21.0): the machines' works and the survey on their
# bearing, people's remains and shelters, neon only on the works, the relay
# line and the shacks that wired stolen light in. Each stop teleports to a
# place GenWorks recorded, then walks in through the real input and looks.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/landscape.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0
coast calm
place spawn
hour 10.5
walk 1,1 1.6
shot 01-spawn-what-was-lost
# The coast: the intake humming at the shore, a trawler on the sand.
place intake
walk 0,1 0.8
shot 02-coast-intake-day
hour 21.2
wait 0.5
shot 03-coast-intake-dusk
hour 10.5
place hulk
walk -1,0 0.8
shot 04-coast-hulk-day
place turf_rows
walk 1,0 1.0
shot 05-coast-turf-rows-day
# The moss: the drained fen, its pump house and pipeline.
place drained
walk 0,-1 0.8
shot 06-moss-drained-day
hour 21.3
wait 0.5
shot 07-moss-drained-dusk
hour 10.5
place bog_graves
walk 1,0 0.6
shot 08-moss-bog-graves-day
# The pines: a clearcut in its square, the relay corridor, the fire tower.
place clearcut
walk 1,-1 1.0
shot 09-pinewood-clearcut-day
place corridor
walk 1,0 1.0
shot 10-pinewood-corridor-day
hour 21.4
wait 0.5
shot 11-pinewood-corridor-dusk
hour 10.5
place fire_tower
walk 0,1 0.6
shot 12-pinewood-fire-tower-day
# The snowfield: the checkpoint gate on its road, the grid hung with ice, the stack.
place checkpoint
walk -1,0 0.8
shot 13-snowfield-checkpoint-day
hour 21.2
wait 0.5
shot 14-snowfield-checkpoint-dusk
hour 12
place iced_line
walk 0,1 0.6
shot 15-snowfield-iced-line-day
place stack
walk 0,1 1.0
shot 16-snowfield-stack-day
# The bonelands: the quarry benches, the drill field on its grid.
place quarry
walk 1,0 0.8
shot 17-bonelands-quarry-day
place drill_field
walk 0,-1 0.8
shot 18-bonelands-drill-field-day
hour 21.2
wait 0.5
shot 19-bonelands-drill-field-dusk
hour 10.5
# The burning: slag heaps tipped on the bearing, the clerks' archive.
place slag
walk -1,1 0.8
shot 20-burning-slag-day
place archive
walk 1,0 0.8
shot 21-burning-archive-day
hour 21.3
wait 0.5
shot 22-burning-archive-dusk
# A shack that wired the machines' light into its wall, after dusk.
place stolen_light
walk 1,0 0.5
hour 21.5
wait 0.6
shot 23-stolen-light-dusk
